stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT
    DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL: Employee submits current version
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED: Direct manager rejects with reason
    REJECTED --> DRAFT: Employee explicitly reopens
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED: Direct manager approves
    APPROVED --> [*]
    note right of DRAFT
        Entries and decimal totals update atomically.
        Every mutation checks the aggregate version.
    end note
    note right of APPROVED
        Read-only timesheet; immutable decision history.
        Finance export is a separate operation.
    end note
